<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1880275338"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1586989634"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ツノ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="うじたまい / 40mP"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ツノ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:33.124"><div begin="00:00.475" end="04:33.124"><p begin="00:00.475" end="00:03.552" itunes:key="L1">ツノをもった少年は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">头上长着犄角的少年</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ： u ji ta ma i</span></p><p begin="00:03.553" end="00:06.195" itunes:key="L2">部屋でぽつり呟いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在房间内小声嘟囔着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">he ya de po tsu ri tsu bu ya i ta</span></p><p begin="00:06.196" end="00:21.905" itunes:key="L3">『僕は人間じゃないらしい』<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">『我好像不是人类』</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 bo ku ha ni n ge n ja na i ra shi i 』</span></p><p begin="00:21.906" end="00:24.841" itunes:key="L4">寂しがり屋の少年は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">害怕寂寞的少年</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa bi shi ga ri ya no sho u ne n ha</span></p><p begin="00:24.842" end="00:27.662" itunes:key="L5">いつも何故か1人ぼっち<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知为何总是孤身一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo na ze ka hi to ri bo 'c chi</span></p><p begin="00:27.663" end="00:33.088" itunes:key="L6">時計の響く銀の街で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在时钟声回荡的这个银色城市</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ke i no hi bi ku gi n no ma chi de</span></p><p begin="00:33.089" end="00:36.376" itunes:key="L7">ある日突然現れた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">某天突然出现的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru hi to tsu ze n a ra wa re ta</span></p><p begin="00:36.377" end="00:39.060" itunes:key="L8">耳の上のそのツノは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耳朵上的那个犄角</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi mi no u e no so no tsu no ha</span></p><p begin="00:39.061" end="00:44.573" itunes:key="L9">まるで世界を変えました<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛将整个世界都改变了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ru de se ka i wo ka e ma shi ta</span></p><p begin="00:44.574" end="00:46.056" itunes:key="L10">"なんで？"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“为什么？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">&quot; na n de ？&quot;</span></p><p begin="00:46.057" end="00:47.328" itunes:key="L11">『つまんないの』<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">『因为很无聊嘛』</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 tsu ma n na i no 』</span></p><p begin="00:47.329" end="00:48.973" itunes:key="L12">"ねぇなんで？"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“喂 为什么？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">&quot; ne na n de ？&quot;</span></p><p begin="00:48.974" end="00:51.051" itunes:key="L13">『嫌われ役でしょ』<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">『是注定被讨厌的角色吧』</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 ki ra wa re ya ku de sho 』</span></p><p begin="00:51.052" end="00:55.946" itunes:key="L14">言われ続けてたその言葉は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那句话被重复了无数次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i wa re tsu du ke te ta so no ko to ba ha</span></p><p begin="00:55.947" end="00:57.508" itunes:key="L15">"なんで？"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“为什么？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">&quot; na n de ？&quot;</span></p><p begin="00:57.509" end="00:58.764" itunes:key="L16">『不思議だもの』<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">『因为很不可思议嘛』</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 fu shi gi da mo no 』</span></p><p begin="00:58.765" end="01:00.358" itunes:key="L17">"ねぇなんで？"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“喂 为什么？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">&quot; ne na n de ？&quot;</span></p><p begin="01:00.359" end="01:02.479" itunes:key="L18">『可愛いから』ってさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">『因为很可爱』这句回答</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 ka wa i i ka ra 』 't te sa</span></p><p begin="01:02.480" end="01:04.907" itunes:key="L19">チヤホヤな裏返し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反而像句反话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ya ho ya na u ra ga e shi</span></p><p begin="01:04.908" end="01:07.120" itunes:key="L20">僕はなんだったっけ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我到底是什么呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha na n da 't ta 'k ke ？</span></p><p begin="01:07.121" end="01:08.542" itunes:key="L21">リトルモンスター<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小小的怪兽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri to ru mo n su ta a</span></p><p begin="01:08.543" end="01:10.545" itunes:key="L22">バケモノのままで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就以怪兽的姿态</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ba ke mo no no ma ma de</span></p><p begin="01:10.546" end="01:13.946" itunes:key="L23">そっと踊りだすランランドゥ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄悄地起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so 't to o do ri da su ra n ra n du</span></p><p begin="01:13.947" end="01:18.241" itunes:key="L24">愛してる好きをもっと送るよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要将内心的爱意更多的传达出去啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ru su ki wo mo 't to o ku ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:18.242" end="01:19.995" itunes:key="L25">夢見た世界は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦中的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me mi ta se ka i ha</span></p><p begin="01:19.996" end="01:21.634" itunes:key="L26">みずみずしくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是如此鲜明水灵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi zu mi zu shi ku te</span></p><p begin="01:21.635" end="01:25.415" itunes:key="L27">でもなんで乾いた視線に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但为什么在冷漠的视线中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo na n de ka wa i ta shi se n ni</span></p><p begin="01:25.416" end="01:28.016" itunes:key="L28">身体ごと 心ごと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全身心都</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ra da go to ko ko ro go to</span></p><p begin="01:28.017" end="01:41.827" itunes:key="L29">カラカラ音がした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">发出生锈的声音呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ra ka ra o to ga shi ta</span></p><p begin="01:41.828" end="01:43.201" itunes:key="L30">"だぁれ？"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“是谁？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">&quot; da re ？&quot;</span></p><p begin="01:43.202" end="01:44.474" itunes:key="L31">『王子様に』<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">『变成了王子』</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 o u ji sa ma ni 』</span></p><p begin="01:44.475" end="01:46.068" itunes:key="L32">"ねぇだぁれ？"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“喂 是谁？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">&quot; ne da re ？&quot;</span></p><p begin="01:46.069" end="01:48.216" itunes:key="L33">『ヒーローになってさ』<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">『变成了英雄』</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 hi i ro o ni na 't te sa 』</span></p><p begin="01:48.217" end="01:53.410" itunes:key="L34">過去が産み出した彼の夢も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连带着他过去的梦想一同</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ko ga u mi da shi ta ka re no yu me mo</span></p><p begin="01:53.411" end="01:54.690" itunes:key="L35">"だぁれ？"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“是谁？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">&quot; da re ？&quot;</span></p><p begin="01:54.691" end="01:55.925" itunes:key="L36">『優しい人』<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">『温柔的人』</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 ya sa shi i hi to 』</span></p><p begin="01:55.926" end="01:57.556" itunes:key="L37">ねぇなんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne na n te</span></p><p begin="01:57.557" end="01:59.553" itunes:key="L38">言われる度にさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当被这么问的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i wa re ru ta bi ni sa</span></p><p begin="01:59.554" end="02:04.178" itunes:key="L39">甘いだけ残らない綿菓子のようだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心就像没有一丝甜味的棉花糖一样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ma i da ke no ko ra na i wa ta ga shi no yo u da</span></p><p begin="02:04.179" end="02:05.795" itunes:key="L40">リトルモンスター<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小小的怪兽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri to ru mo n su ta a</span></p><p begin="02:05.796" end="02:07.716" itunes:key="L41">ちっぽけなツノが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那不起眼的犄角</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi 'p po ke na tsu no ga</span></p><p begin="02:07.717" end="02:11.070" itunes:key="L42">ちょっとずっしりと重くって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">稍微变得有些沉重</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cho 't to zu 's shi ri to o mo ku 't te</span></p><p begin="02:11.071" end="02:15.362" itunes:key="L43">歌うのも踊るのも叶わない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论是想唱歌还是想跳舞 都无法如愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ta u no mo o do ru no mo ka na wa na i</span></p><p begin="02:15.363" end="02:17.167" itunes:key="L44">嘲笑う声、<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘲笑的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a za wa ra u ko e</span></p><p begin="02:17.168" end="02:20.008" itunes:key="L45">高鳴る音"僕はだぁれ？"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">高鸣的声音“我到底是谁？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ka na ru o to &quot; bo ku ha da re ？&quot;</span></p><p begin="02:20.009" end="02:22.524" itunes:key="L46">こぼれた言葉は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说出的这句话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko bo re ta ko to ba ha</span></p><p begin="02:22.525" end="02:25.115" itunes:key="L47">人々の肩かすめ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与人们擦肩而过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to bi to no ka ta ka su me</span></p><p begin="02:25.116" end="02:28.644" itunes:key="L48">ゆらゆら揺らいでく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摇曳着消失不见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra yu ra yu ra i de ku</span></p><p begin="02:28.645" end="02:31.462" itunes:key="L49">産まれたときから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自诞生之时以来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ta to ki ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:31.463" end="02:34.247" itunes:key="L50">"みんなと同じ"を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就被要求以“与大家相同”的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">&quot; mi n na to o na ji &quot; wo</span></p><p begin="02:34.248" end="02:39.137" itunes:key="L51">歩かされてきたはずでした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">步伐前进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru ka sa re te ki ta ha zu de shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:39.138" end="02:42.839" itunes:key="L52">後になって何か<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到了后来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a to ni na 't te na ni ka</span></p><p begin="02:42.840" end="02:45.545" itunes:key="L53">人と違うもの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又被要求寻找</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to to chi ga u mo no</span></p><p begin="02:45.546" end="02:51.641" itunes:key="L54">求められる生き方<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与众不同的生存方式</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo to me ra re ru i ki ka ta</span></p><p begin="02:51.642" end="02:55.696" itunes:key="L55">『ねぇ上手くできないなぁ』<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">『我无法顺利的完成呢』</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 ne u ma ku de ki na i na 』</span></p><p begin="02:55.697" end="02:57.204" itunes:key="L56">リトルモンスター<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小小的怪兽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri to ru mo n su ta a</span></p><p begin="02:57.205" end="02:58.785" itunes:key="L57">逃げ出したとき<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逃离现实的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ge da shi ta to ki</span></p><p begin="02:58.786" end="03:02.487" itunes:key="L58">目の前に現れた少女<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">出现在眼前的少女</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me no ma e ni a ra wa re ta sho u jo</span></p><p begin="03:02.488" end="03:07.013" itunes:key="L59">頭には同じツノを持って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">头上有着相同的犄角</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ma ni ha o na ji tsu no wo mo 't te</span></p><p begin="03:07.014" end="03:09.515" itunes:key="L60">『生き辛いね、わたしもなの』<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">『你活得很辛苦吧 我也一样啊』</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 i ki tsu ra i ne wa ta shi mo na no 』</span></p><p begin="03:09.516" end="03:13.905" itunes:key="L61">なんて笑って手を差し出しました<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这么说着 向少年伸出了手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te wa ra 't te te wo sa shi da shi ma shi ta</span></p><p begin="03:13.906" end="03:15.301" itunes:key="L62">なぜだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ze da ro u</span></p><p begin="03:15.302" end="03:20.742" itunes:key="L63">涙がボロボロと落ちてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼泪不断从眼眶滑落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi da ga bo ro bo ro to o chi te yu ku</span></p><p begin="03:20.743" end="03:22.203" itunes:key="L64">リトルモンスター<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小小的怪兽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri to ru mo n su ta a</span></p><p begin="03:22.204" end="03:23.775" itunes:key="L65">バケモノ同士<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怪兽同伴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ba ke mo no do u shi</span></p><p begin="03:23.776" end="03:27.481" itunes:key="L66">手をとって踊り出すランランドゥ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">牵着手 一同起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te wo to 't te o do ri da su ra n ra n du</span></p><p begin="03:27.482" end="03:31.787" itunes:key="L67">傷口に愛がそっと溢れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从伤口中悄悄流出了爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu gu chi ni a i ga so 't to a fu re te</span></p><p begin="03:31.788" end="03:33.661" itunes:key="L68">彼女は歌った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她唱起了歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka no jo ha u ta 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:33.662" end="03:35.579" itunes:key="L69">『重くなったモノは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">『背负的沉重生活</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 o mo ku na 't ta mo no ha</span></p><p begin="03:35.580" end="03:38.956" itunes:key="L70">きっと誰かと持つの』と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定要和某人分担才能活下去』</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to da re ka to mo tsu no 』 to</span></p><p begin="03:38.957" end="03:41.527" itunes:key="L71">身体ごと 心ごと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全身心都</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ra da go to ko ko ro go to</span></p><p begin="03:41.528" end="03:46.553" itunes:key="L72">満たされる音がした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">发出来被满足的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ta sa re ru o to ga shi ta</span></p><p begin="03:46.554" end="03:48.971" itunes:key="L73">あぁそう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 是啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a so u</span></p><p begin="03:48.972" end="03:52.257" itunes:key="L74">これはきっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些一定是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re ha ki 't to</span></p><p begin="03:52.258" end="04:33.124" itunes:key="L75">全ての『君』のお話。<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">关于『你』的所有故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te no 『 ki mi 』 no o ha na shi</span></p></div></body></tt>